sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: The CSMS supports local cost calculation by CS
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CS has TariffCtrlr.Enabled[Tariff] = true
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CS has TariffCtrlr.MaxElements[Tariff] > 0

    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to change the tariff of the transaction

    CSMS->>CS: ChangeTransactionTariffRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: transactionId must be <transaction id>

    CS-->>CSMS: ChangeTransactionTariffResponse (status = TooManyElements)
